---
import { examplePath } from '../data/site';
---
<div class="example">
  <div class="example-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Example</p>
      <h3>One reading, five connected objects.</h3>
      <p>
        A vibration above 8.2&nbsp;mm/s on a class 7F gas turbine generates a finding. That
        finding is linked to the asset, the site, the engagement and the lender concerned, along
        with the rule that produced it.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="rule-card" aria-label="The rule that produces the finding">
<pre><b>rule</b>   VIB-002 (version 3)
<b>if</b>     asset.class = GAS-TURBINE-7F
<b>and</b>    bearing_vibration > 8.2 mm/s
<b>then</b>   finding "Vibration above threshold"
       reviewed by a senior engineer</pre>
      <figcaption>Illustrative example.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
  <ol class="path" aria-label="Relationship path of the finding">
    {examplePath.map((step) => (
      <li>
        <span class="node"><small>{step.kind}</small>{step.label}</span>
        {step.edge && <span class="edge">{step.edge}</span>}
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
</div>
